flowchart TD
    START[Candidate existing document]
    DP1[DP1 exact-ref evidence]
    AUTH{Authority, readers, writers, gates and rollback proven?}
    FULL{Every byte canonical-source reconstructable?}
    SPLIT{Current and history can use separate targets?}
    HYBRID{One document still required with complete partition ownership?}
    HEAD{Managed-head constraints proven?}

    NOMIG[no migration]
    MANUAL[manual document]
    FULLFORM[full projection]
    SPLITFORM[split projection]
    HYBRIDFORM[hybrid document]
    HEADFORM[managed-head projection]

    PLAN[Immutable migration plan]
    RBP[Rollback package]
    LIFE[DPA-300 lifecycle mutation]
    GATES[DPA-500 gates]
    SER[DPA-600 integration revalidation]
    ACCEPT[accepted migration]
    FAIL[blocked or abandoned migration]
    RB{Rollback required?}
    RESTORE[Restore exact prior bytes, contracts and state]
    INVALIDATE[Invalidate acceptance for non-reproducible exact-byte restore]
    REMED[Maintainer-governed remediation]

    START --> DP1
    DP1 --> AUTH
    AUTH -->|no| NOMIG
    AUTH -->|manual remains safest| MANUAL
    AUTH -->|yes| FULL

    FULL -->|yes| FULLFORM
    FULL -->|no| SPLIT
    SPLIT -->|yes| SPLITFORM
    SPLIT -->|no| HYBRID
    HYBRID -->|no| NOMIG
    HYBRID -->|yes| HEAD
    HEAD -->|yes| HEADFORM
    HEAD -->|no, other hybrid proven| HYBRIDFORM
    HEAD -->|no safe hybrid| NOMIG

    FULLFORM --> PLAN
    SPLITFORM --> PLAN
    HYBRIDFORM --> PLAN
    HEADFORM --> PLAN

    PLAN --> RBP
    RBP -->|recoverable| LIFE
    RBP -->|not recoverable| NOMIG
    LIFE --> GATES
    GATES -->|pass| SER
    GATES -->|warning/failure| FAIL
    SER -->|current| ACCEPT
    SER -->|stale or indeterminate| FAIL

    FAIL --> RB
    RB -->|exact rollback inputs available| RESTORE
    RESTORE -->|renderer reproducibility not claimed| INVALIDATE
    RB -->|rollback unproven| REMED

    NOTE1[No new canonical history source]
    NOTE2[Historical prose is never auto-merged]
    NOTE3[Renderer semantic version controls reproducibility]
    NOTE4[Evidence explains but does not select authority]

    NOTE1 -. constraint .-> RBP
    NOTE2 -. preservation .-> HEADFORM
    NOTE2 -. recovery .-> RESTORE
    NOTE3 -. rollback .-> RBP
    NOTE3 -. acceptance consequence .-> INVALIDATE
    NOTE4 -. boundary .-> DP1
